            "review_title": "Review at Pho Nho - Pho Thin",
            "review_text": "Matt Rose\nShanghai, China53 contributions\n1\nPass on the Northern style Pho!\nDec 2018 • Friends\nMy friend and I stumbled across this restaurant looking for a good Pho place for dinner. The atmosphere was really cool and the walls are painted to look like a street. However like many have said it seemed very dirty. The Pho was like warm and I didn’t really like the broth until I added a lot of extras of hot sauce and hoisin sauce. Over it tasted like a Asian chicken noodle soup. It was worth a try but if you are looking for really good Pho look again.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2018",
