            "review_text": "Sarah\nSalisbury, United Kingdom14 contributions\n1\nDirty WC...Cat poos directly outside of ladies!\nJul 2016 • Couples\nThe food was ok but let's see how we feel in a few hours if you know what I mean! \n\nThe decor inside is lovely and the service was ok, but I nipped to the loo whilst here which was a major mistake! \n\nIt's really grubby, with an old mop in the corner of the toilet that looks like it hasn't been cleaned or replaced for years. The area out the back smells grim and a when I left the cubicle, there was a cat directly in front of me outside taking a poo in a grubby litter tray... \n\nDelightful. \n\nHaving said that, I'm not slagging off the cat. When it's got to go, it's got to go! It's beautiful, really friendly and was the best thing about the place!\nRead more\nWritten July 29, 2016",
