            "review_text": "Khoa Tien N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nGive it a shot to northern style Pho\nJan 2016 • Family\nDropped by with my wife for breakfast from my colleague's recommendation. Rated 4 in my opinion since:\n- Location: not to close to the central. Need a ride or cab to be here.\n- Decorations: nice little old Hanoi with drawings along the wall.\n- Star of the meal - Pho: right northern style Pho with great seasoned. I love the taste of dried beef put inside.\n\nBut I dont see so much customers during the time we are here even on Saturday morning.\n\nIn sum, worth give it a shot.\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2016",
