            "review_title": "Review at Pho Nho - Pho Thin",
            "review_text": "Liz B\nMelbourne, Australia199 contributions\n0\nWorth experiencing this local eating place\nJan 2013 • Friends\nVery difficult to explain the entrance of this local eatery. \n\nIt is frequented mainly by locals so the food is good. We all enjoyed it and I particularly loved the interior of this place and couldn't help but take photos. The owners didn't mind at all and were surprised of my taking photos. We loved our Vietnamese noodle soups, they were very much enjoyed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2013",
